  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0105_06d33f6145e7.png\" style=\"width: 196px; height: 200px;\" /></p><p>Charge on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>V</mi></math><br />Charge on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn><mi>V</mi></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0105_a5286c7e6088.png\" style=\"width: 201px; height: 200px;\" /></p><p>From charge conservation, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>C</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>V</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>C</mi><mo>)</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></math><br />Common potential,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>V</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>V</mi></math><br />Final energy,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p>"
  }
